				NewString: 融合力量属性初始为0%（最高为 50%）
			}

			8: {
				// OldString: it'll increase by a small amount every second as long as the players are fused.
				NewString: 只要玩家处于融合状态，它每秒都会有小幅提升
			}

			9: {
				// OldString: Fusion only lasts for 5 minutes and it has a cooldown of 15 minutes.
				NewString: 融合仅持续5分钟，冷却时间为15分钟
			}

			10: {
				// OldString: Fusion will break if the players are too far away from each other (50 blocks),
				NewString: 如果玩家彼此距离过远超过50 格，或者其中一名玩家死亡
			}

			11: {
				// OldString: or if one player dies.
				NewString: 融合将会解除
			}

			12: {
				// OldString: Fusion effects. defense, damage, hp, mana, flight time, aggro, attack speed, luck
				NewString: 融合效果：防御、伤害、生命值、魔力、飞行时间、仇恨、攻击速度、幸运
			}

			13: {
				// OldString: Check Controls for fusion UI
				NewString: 打开融合界面以查看
			}
		}

